        "created_at": "2011-10-31T21:00:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey Greater Than Games team!  At PAX you mentioned you would make the pdf of the cool playmat you used available to us for printing.  Is that still in the works?  We’re finding it a bit of a bear to keep track of what goes where throughout the course of the game, and that would definitely come in handy.</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
