        "id": 23874,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-21T16:56:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It is a big mat with spaces for your deck, trash, in play cards, etc that we use for demos at conventions.  We are going to be posting a PDF of the mat, and will consider selling high-quality vinyl mats like we use at conventions if there is enough interest.  It will be a few weeks until we can post this, however, since right now all of our time is consumed with getting Rook City ready for the printer <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:57:51.837Z",
